{%- comment -%}
  Kinsoul Energy — llms.txt page template
  Renders a Shopify page with handle "llms-txt" as plain-text-friendly output,
  with no theme layout (no header/footer/scripts/styles). Combined with an
  Admin URL Redirect (/llms.txt → /pages/llms-txt) this lets AI crawlers
  fetch llms.txt at the canonical short URL.

  Setup (Phase 5 admin task):
    1. Online Store → Pages → Add page
       - Title: llms.txt — Kinsoul Energy
       - Handle: llms-txt
       - Template suffix: llms-txt (this file)
       - Content: paste the contents of assets/llms.txt verbatim (Show HTML mode)
    2. Online Store → Navigation → URL redirects → Add redirect
       - From: /llms.txt
       - To:   /pages/llms-txt
       - This makes the canonical /llms.txt URL serve the page content.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% layout none %}{{ page.content | strip_html }}
